<Content
  kicker="Legal"
  title="Acceptable Use Policy"
  description="What you may and may not do on Saa Thum — across live streams, paid 1:1 sessions, marketplace listings, messaging and AI features."
  image="/og/acceptable-use.png"
  lead="The rules for everything you send, say, sell, or generate on Saa Thum."
  updated="2026-08-05"
>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.88414822d92db4df">This Acceptable Use Policy applies to every part of Saa Thum: one-to-one and group messaging,
    audio and video calls, live video, marketplace listings, live consultations, and our AI
    features. It sits alongside our</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.6201111b83a0cb5b">and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.5e0f74c160500cbf" href="/community-guidelines">Community Guidelines</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.4bea10b4580730f5">. If you break these rules, we may
    limit, suspend, or terminate your access.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.11f01dd76588fa3b">Your agreement is with</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.b321f789aa69e114">Saa Thum</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.0208379910b00836">.
    See</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.fd1bcee3cdf39081" href="/terms#status">who we are</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.0ae77af72f5ca7aa">1. Who this applies to</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.34b6bf2de7332748">
    Everyone who uses Saa Thum — senders and receivers, buyers and sellers, consultants and clients,
    viewers and hosts. It applies to public content and to private communications, and it applies
    to what you do through our AI features as much as to what you type yourself.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.9ef6ae8fd5f3acfb">2. Prohibited content and conduct</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.59a64b3adde2d4f6">Do not use Saa Thum to do, share, host, sell, or promote any of the following.</p>

  <h3 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.aa69a537fcfa52ea">Harm to people</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.aa2e0e9061a473b5">Harassment and bullying</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.2207b61dc207b8a0">— targeting, demeaning, stalking, or repeatedly
      contacting someone who does not want to hear from you.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e562e8ead932801f">Hate</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.ba648b1af1aa663d">— attacking or dehumanising people based on race, ethnicity, caste,
      religion, national origin, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any
      similar characteristic.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.4bbaf10deb9da32d">Threats and violence</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.ee1ff9bd5de8f14d">— threatening, inciting, glorifying, or coordinating
      violence, or threatening to expose someone's private information.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.48d8b77dcd75e4c6">Self-harm</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.2fc183743b603dbd">— encouraging or instructing others in self-harm, suicide, or
      dangerous behaviour.</ui-copy></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.a41dd815f464e4c1">Sexual content and exploitation</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.93c0191d9453d83d">Any sexual content involving a minor</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.0624311b0646076f">is absolutely prohibited, in any
      format, including AI-generated or drawn depictions. See our</ui-copy>
      <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.38dcbb4c298d7d4a" href="/child-safety">Child Safety Standards</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.62656824a912ed4c">for our full position and how to report.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.52f8b1eb3fc09c17">Non-consensual intimate imagery</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.5198c6a734ef1c98">— sharing, threatening to share, or
      soliciting intimate images of a person without their consent, including images created or
      altered to look like them.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e52d524fe16778d0">Sexual services</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.3abf86166b9bf50e">— offering, requesting, or arranging commercial sexual
      services through any Saa Thum surface.</ui-copy></li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.98f1bcda4a24f085">Sexually explicit material in public surfaces, profiles, listings, or unsolicited
      messages.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.fa1401084c7b742c">Deception and abuse of the platform</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.94a9eac404c8c6ff">Spam</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.a85c7a0162a554a2">— bulk, repetitive, or unsolicited messages, calls, invitations,
      listings, or engagement-inflating behaviour.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.96865aac97ddef96">Scams and fraud</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e3a11828fb4a1a85">— phishing, fake offers, advance-fee schemes, payment
      fraud, chargeback abuse, money laundering, or manipulating payouts, referrals, or promotions.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.0595515700012854">Impersonation</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.27f134bc87fb36f4">— pretending to be another person, business, or
      organisation, or falsely claiming an affiliation, endorsement, or professional
      qualification.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.a1b0e3b6aa2067f9">Platform abuse</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.77c59561813d631d">— scraping, automated access we have not authorised,
      probing or bypassing security, reverse engineering, or interfering with the service.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.518a3b2192d9d797">Malware</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.09933a51fcaae26c">— distributing viruses, spyware, ransomware, or links intended to
      compromise a device or account.</ui-copy></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.2cc37b756eae1576">Illegal and infringing material</h3>
  <ul>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.bf443c70f716dbc6">Illegal goods or services, including drugs, weapons, stolen data, forged documents, and
      regulated items you are not licensed to sell.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.6b2dbffccd3fbaf8">Gambling, financial products, or other regulated offerings where you do not hold the
      required licences.</li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.a9c5e798a440a240">Intellectual property infringement</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.39e7e64040e4f004">— posting or selling content you do not
      have the rights to. Rights holders can report infringement through our</ui-copy>
      <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.0606b89431ebdb4b" href="/dmca">DMCA / Copyright</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.06515066a9e85744">process.</ui-copy></li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.b7030f6b7dff699a">Sharing another person's private information — address, phone number, identity documents,
      financial details — without their consent.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.baeb4d9e87510c0f">3. Live calls, video, and consultations</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.4be3dc8f73ae0dc5">Everything above applies during a live call or session, including exposing yourself, showing
    prohibited content on camera, or using a call to harass someone. If you record a call, our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.f6998897105b6f99" href="/recording">Recording &amp; Consent</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.3a09e9875307fe94">policy applies. Consultations have additional
    rules in the</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.38b192d727fcafd2" href="/consultation-terms">Live Consultation Terms</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.b873ce8b6ee329af">4. Using the AI features</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.d67f0fa5c73b9146">
    Saa Thum includes AI features, including the Ava assistant and an AI receptionist that can answer
    calls on your behalf. The rules above apply to anything you generate with them. In particular,
    do not:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.7b4e8727f27130c8">Prompt AI features to produce content that would be prohibited if you posted it yourself —
      including abusive, hateful, sexual, or exploitative material.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e9053aeb385d4b0a">Attempt to circumvent, jailbreak, or disable safety measures, filters, or usage limits.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e551b40efaf6853b">Use AI output to impersonate a real person, clone someone's voice or likeness without their
      consent, or generate misleading content presented as real.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.31dcab85ac23682f">Automate the AI features for bulk outreach, scripted calling, or resale as your own
      service.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.8d70ca4ecf02a02b">Use the AI receptionist to deceive callers about who or what they are speaking to where
      disclosure is required by law.</li>
  </ul>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.41935e2535be9d5e">
    AI output can be wrong. You are responsible for what you send, publish, or act on, whether you
    wrote it or an AI feature did.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e669b647f5029b0b">5. Accounts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.bdf5ac825dfec21a">Your account is for you. Do not share your login or let someone else use your account.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.7729924f6a13ca35">Do not create multiple accounts to evade limits, suspensions, blocks, or promotions, or to
      inflate ratings and engagement.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.33e6adc7ed713c09">Do not buy, sell, rent, or transfer an account.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.224c6ee7bfc2dd9c">Do not create an account if you are under the minimum age for your country, or if we have
      previously terminated your access.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.78d6aba7a71645ed">Legitimate separate accounts — for example a personal account and a business account, or
      accounts for different family members on a shared device — are fine, as long as you are not
      using them to evade enforcement.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.57538b9a131931e6">6. Enforcement</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.5f381fa76b4ae850">
    We review reports and may act on what we find. What we do depends on how serious the violation
    is, whether it is repeated, and the harm involved. We may take any of these steps, in any
    order, and we may skip straight to termination for severe violations:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e981ddae45d8f4ca">Warning</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.04835248bf09491f">— a notice explaining what broke the rules.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.1be78f906ea1d85c">Content removal</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.16826b622c5eb0e7">— taking down a post, listing, profile detail, or message
      we can access.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.00a6759014cdc2bf">Feature limits</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.f9249890c089945d">— restricting calling, messaging strangers, selling,
      publishing, or AI usage for a period.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.acf82993e1bcd2b9">Suspension</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.824b1ad77b14f755">— temporarily disabling the account.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.eec69ae209127e83">Permanent termination</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.87d85db93bebb4b6">— closing the account and, where we can, preventing
      re-registration.</ui-copy></li>
  </ul>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e20d9327aedc66e6">
    We may also withhold or reverse payouts connected to fraudulent activity, and we may report
    conduct to law enforcement or preserve and disclose information where required by law or valid
    legal process. Severe violations — child sexual exploitation, credible threats of violence,
    serious fraud — usually mean immediate permanent termination without a warning first.
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.27062aa11adce8d7">
      Enforcement is not a judgment about you as a person, and it is not always perfect. If we get
      it wrong, tell us — see the appeal section below.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.98e7ae3362de3609">7. How to report a violation</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.7ad9a32fb7e6228b">You can report an account, a conversation, a listing, or a piece of content from inside the
    app, and you can block any account immediately, which stops their calls and messages reaching
    you. You can also email</ui-copy> support (@) saathum.com<ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.ea6e6803570e31ce">. Tell us what
    happened, where, and when, and include screenshots or a link if you have one. We review reports
    we receive and act where a violation is confirmed.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.869457ce139adcb8">For child safety concerns, see</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.38dcbb4c298d7d4a" href="/child-safety">Child Safety Standards</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.d2a4788a3a1e8500">. For
    copyright, see</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.0606b89431ebdb4b" href="/dmca">DMCA / Copyright</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.f06bf7d68a7daf8c">. You can also use our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.b5d03028fbc1d7ac" href="/grievance">Grievance Redressal</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.8f162d3f5e317a55">process. If someone is in immediate danger,
    contact your local emergency services first — Saa Thum is not an emergency service.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.72270feeba4c59dc">8. How to appeal</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.882d05f8cd39e750">If we limit, suspend, or terminate your account and you think we made a mistake, email</ui-copy>
    support (@) saathum.com <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.a70a62309f0b297c">from the address on the account.
    Include your handle and anything that helps explain the situation. We will look at the decision
    again and tell you the outcome. You may escalate through</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.b5d03028fbc1d7ac" href="/grievance">Grievance Redressal</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.e369ec3c29867cd0">9. Changes</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.6795f0e4b9f183e3">
    We may update this policy as the product and the law change. We will post the updated version
    here and revise the date above.
  </p>

  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.d23bb8e751752451">Questions about this policy? Email</ui-copy> support (@) saathum.com<ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.6daa072a245a026a">.
    See also our</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.5e0f74c160500cbf" href="/community-guidelines">Community Guidelines</a>,
    <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.4aa9bfd2f175a94a">, and</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-acceptable-use.506ff394621596dd" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
